        },
        {
          "id": 2681265871,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Hi, we typically only backport bug fixes from the master branch to release branches. This change will be in the next major release, which should be out in the next couple of months. If you need an installer that includes this change now, you can download one of the 4.5.0rc0 development installers at https://www.wireshark.org/download/automated/.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
